'''Dwarven O's Gemstone Grahams''' are an {{Epic}} [[Consumable]]. They are obtained by completing [[Crystal Nucleus]] runs.

== Obtaining ==
'''Dwarven O's Gemstone Grahams''' has a {{Green|0.4719868%}} chance to drop from the {{Zone|Crystal Nucleus}} upon completing a Nucleus Run, and has a weight of {{Aqua|1,450}}.

== Usage ==
'''Dwarven O's Gemstone Grahams''' can be consumed up to {{Green|5}} times. Each '''Dwarven O's Gemstone Grahams''' eaten permanently increases the player's {{Stat|gf}} by {{Stat|gf|+2|icononly=yes}}, up to {{Stat|gf|+10}}.

